        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virtual pet device in the corner of your screen! Feed and play with your pet while you work or play for dopamine boosts that makes even mundane tasks a little more fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you feed and play with your pets, their stats will improve, allowing them to evolve. Meticulously fill out your encyclopedia or just explore and find your favorites! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of this game include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimizable display, to keep the game out of your way while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of pets to discover and play with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of minigames that scale in difficulty with your pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Game Speed to suit YOUR work/play balance.</p></li></ul>",
